---
title: Reset Your Taskip Password
sidebar:
  order: 4
---
You can reset or change your **Taskip password** in two ways: from your **profile settings** if you are already logged in, or from the **login page** if you have forgotten your password.

## **Method 1: Password Reset from Taskip Profile**

If you are already logged in to your Taskip account, you can change your password from your profile settings.

**Steps:**

1. Click the **profile icon** located in the **top-right corner** of the dashboard.
1. Select **Change Password** from the menu.

![](image-19.png)

3. Enter your **current password** for verification.
1. Enter your **new password.**
1. Confirm the **new password.**

![](image-20-1024x503.png)

6. Click **Save Changes** to update your password.

## **Method 2: Reset Password From the Login Page**

**If you forgot your password and cannot log in, you can reset it from the login page.**

**Steps:**

1. Go to the Taskip login page.
1. Click Forgot Password? below the login form.

![](image-21-1024x540.png)

**3. Enter the email address associated with your Taskip account.**

**4. Click Send Reset Link.**

**5. Check your email and open the password reset link.**

**6. Enter your new password and confirm it.**

**7. Save the changes and log in using your new password.**
